{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carceri is a living landscape; a chill, first-person narrative/exploration experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll visit gorgeous, interconnected zones while platforming, talking to cute NPCs, finding  secrets, and taking pictures with a <i>heavily</i> upgradable camera, one that can distort the world beyond your wildest imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also follow a fun story, one about the Programs that run our world. They need your help, human, <strong>because</strong>\u00a0<strong>in Carceri, you aren't a Character, you are YOU, the person at your PC, reading these words. This is their Reality, and you're just visiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941820/extras/89e37e39a5e686746cdc10fc6215b96a.poster.avif?t=1755235360\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941820/extras/89e37e39a5e686746cdc10fc6215b96a.webm?t=1755235360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941820/extras/89e37e39a5e686746cdc10fc6215b96a.mp4?t=1755235360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carceri is a 2-4 hour game made by a single human, a spiritual successor to <strong>ULTRAWORLD EXODUS</strong>. This is no Dark Souls, as anyone can complete the narrative portion, and there's plenty to experience afterwards (like an in-game philosophy podcast).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Works on Steamdeck, and, buying the game gives you the 41 song original soundtrack!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941820/extras/c74db831feea7cd110b2eb30bcdd5bdc.poster.avif?t=1755235360\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941820/extras/c74db831feea7cd110b2eb30bcdd5bdc.webm?t=1755235360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941820/extras/c74db831feea7cd110b2eb30bcdd5bdc.mp4?t=1755235360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carceri is  quietly unlike anything you've played before. It's hard to explain (and sell), but it's absolutely worth the world's most precious resource: your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941820/extras/72fc7199564673639436ac032fbd9632.poster.avif?t=1755235360\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941820/extras/72fc7199564673639436ac032fbd9632.webm?t=1755235360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941820/extras/72fc7199564673639436ac032fbd9632.mp4?t=1755235360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2941820?t=1755235360","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755235360","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941820/60fa7b73a3e63c653bacc6317af36c94bb10a370/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755235360","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941820/60fa7b73a3e63c653bacc6317af36c94bb10a370/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755235360","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3920730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carceri is a living landscape; a chill, first-person narrative/exploration experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll visit gorgeous, interconnected zones while platforming, talking to cute NPCs, finding  secrets, and taking pictures with a <i>heavily</i> upgradable camera, one that can distort the world beyond your wildest imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also follow a fun story, one about the Programs that run our world. They need your help, human, <strong>because</strong>\u00a0<strong>in Carceri, you aren't a Character, you are YOU, the person at your PC, reading these words. This is their Reality, and you're just visiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941820/extras/89e37e39a5e686746cdc10fc6215b96a.poster.avif?t=1755235360\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941820/extras/89e37e39a5e686746cdc10fc6215b96a.webm?t=1755235360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941820/extras/89e37e39a5e686746cdc10fc6215b96a.mp4?t=1755235360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carceri is a 2-4 hour game made by a single human, a spiritual successor to <strong>ULTRAWORLD EXODUS</strong>. This is no Dark Souls, as anyone can complete the narrative portion, and there's plenty to experience afterwards (like an in-game philosophy podcast).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Works on Steamdeck, and, buying the game gives you the 41 song original soundtrack!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video